window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p><i>Stone and Moonlight</i> picks up right where <i>City of Starlight</i> left off with Kaidyn opening a portal to return to Evirness. Balance the magic, bring down the wall, don’t die, and definitely don’t fall in love. No pressure, Kaidyn.</p> <p>Kaidyn answers her friend’s plea for help and returns to Evirness.</p> <p>Struggling with the guilt and anger over how she left, battling her feelings for Reid that threaten her resolve, Kaidyn throws herself into closing gateways and chasing Keystone, the fabled realm of the Keepers, where she hopes to gain answers to all the unresolved questions about Keepers and her magic.</p> <p>A portal hitchhiker sends everything into chaos and delays her mission, raising more questions about her magic and future.</p> <p>When skirmishes erupt at the wall, Kaidyn is pulled into a finely spun web of deceit. But there may be more than one spider holding her captive, and she isn’t sure which one to fear more.</p> <p>One thing is certain; she will not get away unscathed.</p>"; 
